{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../theme/", "title": "Theme"}, "next": {"link": "../timezone/", "title": "Timezone"}, "title": "ThemeSettings", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"themesettings\">\n<h1>ThemeSettings<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#themesettings\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.types.ThemeSettings\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ThemeSettings</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.ThemeSettings\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API type.</p>\n<p>Constructor of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/theme-settings/#pyrogram.raw.base.ThemeSettings\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.ThemeSettings\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ThemeSettings</span></code></a>.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Details:</dt><dd><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Layer: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">222</span></code></p></li>\n<li><p>ID: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">FA58B6D4</span></code></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>base_theme</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/base-theme/#pyrogram.raw.base.BaseTheme\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.BaseTheme\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseTheme</span></code></a>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>accent_color</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</spa